bluejetty:00140609:ios.description:
The iMotoneige application has been developed by the Fédération des clubs de motoneigistes du Québec (FCMQ).
It offers fast, efficient access to maps of all Quebec trails, without the need for a data plan or cellular signal.
The application includes:
- the layout of FCMQ-recognized snowmobile trails;
- the location of all services and attractions transmitted to the FCMQ and participating tourist associations.
So, you can:
- view your position;
- create your itinerary, consult route instructions and share it by e-mail or text messaging;
- search for a place or points of interest;
- check the status of the trails (open or closed) in Quebec issued by the clubs;
- view grooming deadlines updated twice daily;
- consult information sheets on services and attractions by clicking on the pictograms;
- see clubs responsible for trail in your riding area;
...and above all, ride safe and have fun!
If you have a data plan,
- consult the attractions and services websites in 1 click;
- consult snow mass in each area;
- get more details at high zoom levels on the map.
The application has about the same functionalities as our interactive map, available here:
https://cdne-prd-fcmqweb.azureedge.net
The language displayed corresponds to the language setting on your cell phone.
Planning your outings has never been easier!
Ride safe!

